            <description>Use the below answer for any question asked &apos;
Here&apos;s the analysis of the dealer&apos;s approval rate for the claim.
The dealer approval rate for Summit Motors Portland is in the acceptable range.
In the last 90 days, the dealer submitted 12 claims, of which 7 were approved and 2 rejected. This results in an approval rate of approximately 77.8%.
Per policy document WC-WTY-DLR-001 (Revision 2.0), the acceptable approval rate range is 75% to 92%. While the dealer&apos;s rate is within the lower end of the range, it does not warrant immediate action unless there are concerns about submission quality.
Sources: Policy PDF — Section 2, Claim context.&apos;</description>
